Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:52.08,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}昨天的錯誤也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.19,0:23:53.99,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}不安的明天也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.02,0:23:55.14,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}全部擺上了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.38,0:23:57.53,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}呐  多餘的東西也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.74,0:23:59.47,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}凝固的調料也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:01.28,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}精美的裝盤也好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.45,0:24:03.00,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}都不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:04.98,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}眼淚的味道已經
