Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.93,0:24:08.65,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}最後也會一直
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.83,0:24:12.32,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}微笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.48,0:24:15.89,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}笑一笑
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.24,0:24:22.38,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}能對重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.56,0:24:26.97,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}笑一笑
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.22,0:24:30.94,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}比什麼都重要
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.58,0:24:37.72,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an7}這就是調味品
